{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20336","headline":"别段生 · 张籍","name":"别段生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"与子骨肉亲，愿言长相随。\n况离父母傍，从我学书诗。\n同在道路间，讲论亦未亏。\n爲文於我前，日夕生光仪。\n行役多疾疚，赖此相扶持。\n贫贱事难拘，今日有别离。\n我去秦城中，子留汴水湄。\n离情两飘断，不异风中丝。\n幼年独爲客，举动难得宜。\n努力自修励，常如见我时。\n送我登山冈，再拜问还期。\n还期在新年，勿怨欢会迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20336.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20336","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}